  "task_assistant_messages": [
    "John should use the given gasoline price near his parents’ home as his budgeting estimate:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\$3.50\\text{ per gallon}}\n\\]\n\n(The driving distance is \\(2 \\times 75 = 150\\) miles, but fuel efficiency and gas prices along the route are not provided.)",
    "The corrected driving distance is\n\n\\[\n2\\text{ hours}\\times 70\\text{ mph}=140\\text{ miles}.\n\\]\n\nHowever, the driving speed does not affect the gasoline price. Since the only price given is \\(\\$3.50\\) per gallon near his parents’ home, John should budget using\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\$3.50\\text{ per gallon}}.\n\\]",
